---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about Surrey Business Society - our mission, values, and what members can expect from our student-led business community."
>

  <!-- Section 1: Hero / Introduction -->
  <section class="bg-navy-deep text-text-on-dark pt-32 pb-24 sm:pt-40 sm:pb-32 px-6 border-b border-border-dark relative">
    <div class="bg-dot-dark absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-60" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-px bg-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl relative z-10 text-center">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-8 justify-center reveal" style="color:var(--color-gold)">Our Purpose</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-snug reveal">
        We bridge the gap between academic study and the corporate world, equipping Surrey students with the commercial awareness and confidence to excel.
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 2: Our Philosophy / The Story -->
  <section class="py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 border-b border-border bg-surface">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-start">
        
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-32 reveal">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary leading-tight">
            Business is not just a degree.<br />
            <span class="text-gold-dark italic">It's a mindset.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>

        <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-prose text-text-secondary leading-relaxed reveal">
          <p class="mb-8">
            The Surrey Business Society was founded on a simple premise: success in any sector requires an understanding of how value is created, managed, and scaled. While academia provides the theoretical foundation, navigating the complexities of the modern economy demands practical commercial awareness and interdisciplinary thinking.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-8">
            We are resolutely open to students from every faculty and discipline. The modern corporate environment does not operate in silos. The most successful ventures require the analytical rigour of scientists, the problem-solving capabilities of engineers, the creativity of artists, and the strategic foresight of business students.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our mandate is to provide an environment where ambitious individuals can converge. We facilitate exposure to top-tier employers, provide a platform for entrepreneurial ideation, and offer rigorous skills development—ensuring our members graduate not just with a degree, but with a distinct professional advantage.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 3: What We Do (Typographic 2-column text grid) -->
  <section class="py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 bg-surface-alt border-b border-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <header class="mb-20 reveal">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary mb-6">
          Core Objectives
        </h2>
      </header>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-16 gap-y-16 reveal">
        
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-primary mb-4 border-b border-border-dark pb-4">Career Direction</h3>
          <p class="text-base text-text-secondary leading-loose">
            Navigating the graduate market requires strategy. We demystify the recruitment processes of leading firms across consulting, finance, technology, and FMCG. Through sector insights and alumni networking, we help members identify and secure their optimal career path.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-primary mb-4 border-b border-border-dark pb-4">Tangible Skills</h3>
          <p class="text-base text-text-secondary leading-loose">
            A strong CV is only the first hurdle. We run intensive workshops focused on the competencies employers actually test for: commercial awareness, casing, effective communication, and structured problem solving.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-primary mb-4 border-b border-border-dark pb-4">Enterprise</h3>
          <p class="text-base text-text-secondary leading-loose">
            For those drawn to building rather than joining, we provide a nexus for entrepreneurship. By hosting founder talks and facilitating co-founder networking, we aim to be the catalyst for the next generation of Surrey-led startups.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-primary mb-4 border-b border-border-dark pb-4">Interdisciplinary Access</h3>
          <p class="text-base text-text-secondary leading-loose">
            We actively break down faculty barriers. By bringing together students from engineering, law, sciences, and business, we create a diverse talent pool that mirrors the reality of modern cross-functional business teams.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-navy-deep text-text-on-dark py-24 px-6 relative">
    <div class="bg-dot-dark absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center relative z-10 reveal">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Ready to join?</h2>
      <a href="/join" class="btn-primary rounded-none">
        Become a Member <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
